{{ m.h(2, '1. Purpose and design') }}
{{ m.p('Stage 5 estimates incremental validity of game indicators over the criterion battery for the outcomes chosen under the report-use decision, and builds weighted norms (cNORM or GAMLSS on a post-stratified sample, age and education as continuous predictors). Within the grant period norms are provisional; full norms (target 1,500-2,000 per language) are likely post-grant.') }}
{{ m.p('Predictive comparisons use participant-grouped cross-validation with no leakage and an untouched holdout cohort for final confirmation.') }}
